<title>USA: New York Mills, Minn., won by Juran &amp; Moody.</title>
<headline>New York Mills, Minn., won by Juran &amp; Moody.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juran &amp; Moody, Inc., said it won $1.350 million of New York Mills, Minn., general obligation public building bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.43 percent.</p>
</text>
